# ------------------------------------------------------------------
#  spots - mostly-white cat with a few orange spots (photo 3, right):
#    orange cap & ears with a white blaze, white body sprinkled with
#    orange spots, orange-and-white ringed tail, pale yellow-green eyes.
#  Trick: the body colour (O) is white, so the "stripes" (S) on the
#  back become orange spots and the tail becomes ringed.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
name: spots
base: patches
#         body    spots   cap     tail-tip  eyes
palette:  O=255b  S=208   C=208   T=208     A=186b
